{
  "rule": "nonlinear_laplacian_nonuniform",
  "metric": "Linf",
  "expected_min_order": 1.9,
  "notes": "Conservative non-uniform nonlinear Laplacian d/dx(f*du/dx). Face fluxes F_{i+1/2} = 0.5*(f[i]+f[i+1]) * (u[i+1]-u[i]) / dx[i+1] and F_{i-1/2} = 0.5*(f[i-1]+f[i]) * (u[i]-u[i-1]) / dx[i]; divergence = 2*(F_{i+1/2}-F_{i-1/2}) / (dx[i]+dx[i+1]). Reduces to the uniform nonlinear_laplacian_uniform formula when dx is constant. O(h^2) theory; require observed min order >= 1.9 on geometrically-stretched grids."
}
